  "evaluation": {
    "metrics": {
      "value": "空间、全球及总 NRMSE；SSP245 情景的 2080—2100 年四项输出 tas、日较差、pr、pr90；按任务总 NRMSE 的均值排序。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duncanwp/ClimateBench/main/README.md",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scoring": {
      "value": "对2080–2100和三个目标集合成员平均；纬度面积加权，Total NRMSE = Spatial NRMSE + 5 × Global NRMSE；README按四输出Total的均值排行。CRPS是另报概率指标，不进入该headline排序。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://ueaeprints.uea.ac.uk/id/eprint/87693/1/WatsonParris_etal_2022_ClimateBench_AAM.pdf",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        },
